1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,092
The sandwich is ready.

2
00:00:02,242 --> 00:00:04,123
Your phone is at one percent.

3
00:00:04,273 --> 00:00:05,699
Of course it is.

4
00:00:05,849 --> 00:00:07,985
What if you could prepare a payment permission

5
00:00:07,985 --> 00:00:09,350
before your battery gives up?

6
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:12,739
Meet Liber, Ghost Protocol.

7
00:00:12,889 --> 00:00:14,664
A prefunded payment permission

8
00:00:14,664 --> 00:00:16,451
that can leave your phone, and

9
00:00:16,451 --> 00:00:17,350
travel on paper.

10
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:20,450
Choose one merchant, one amount,

11
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:21,241
and an expiry.

12
00:00:21,391 --> 00:00:23,133
Sign that exact permission,

13
00:00:23,133 --> 00:00:24,571
then reserve the tokens.

14
00:00:24,721 --> 00:00:26,459
The contract enforces the

15
00:00:26,459 --> 00:00:26,928
limits.

16
00:00:27,078 --> 00:00:29,350
The paper carries the authorization.

17
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:32,369
Here is the live workspace.

18
00:00:32,519 --> 00:00:34,580
Review the recipient and expiry

19
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:35,553
before signing.

20
00:00:35,703 --> 00:00:37,699
Preparation requires your wallet

21
00:00:37,699 --> 00:00:39,318
and an internet connection.

22
00:00:39,468 --> 00:00:41,498
Only after the reserve is confirmed

23
00:00:41,498 --> 00:00:43,350
should you hand over the voucher.

24
00:00:44,450 --> 00:00:46,406
The buyer can leave the device

25
00:00:46,406 --> 00:00:46,854
behind.

26
00:00:47,004 --> 00:00:48,779
The merchant scans the voucher

27
00:00:48,779 --> 00:00:50,657
and claims with the named wallet.

28
00:00:50,807 --> 00:00:52,878
The merchant still needs internet

29
00:00:52,878 --> 00:00:53,350
and gas.

30
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:56,312
This public testnet receipt shows

31
00:00:56,312 --> 00:00:58,060
five mock tokens transferred to

32
00:00:58,060 --> 00:00:58,770
the merchant.

33
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:00,667
You can inspect the reserve and

34
00:01:00,667 --> 00:01:02,524
redemption transactions yourself.

35
00:01:02,674 --> 00:01:04,436
No wallet login is needed to

36
00:01:04,436 --> 00:01:05,350
view the proof.

37
00:01:06,450 --> 00:01:08,263
A screenshot is not a second

38
00:01:08,263 --> 00:01:08,777
payment.

39
00:01:08,927 --> 00:01:11,005
This recorded interface rejected

40
00:01:11,005 --> 00:01:13,128
the same voucher after redemption.

41
00:01:13,278 --> 00:01:15,201
The contract also rejects replay

42
00:01:15,201 --> 00:01:17,350
and claims from a different merchant.

43
00:01:18,450 --> 00:01:20,560
If the permission expires unused,

44
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:22,474
the owner can reclaim the funds.

45
00:01:22,624 --> 00:01:24,473
This separate test returned

46
00:01:24,473 --> 00:01:25,514
two mock tokens.

47
00:01:25,664 --> 00:01:27,641
Recovery requires an owner

48
00:01:27,641 --> 00:01:29,488
transaction after expiry.

49
00:01:29,638 --> 00:01:31,350
It is not automatic.

50
00:01:32,450 --> 00:01:34,533
Ghost runs on BNB Smart Chain

51
00:01:34,533 --> 00:01:35,102
Testnet.

52
00:01:35,252 --> 00:01:37,255
Mock tokens have no cash value.

53
00:01:37,405 --> 00:01:39,370
Physical phone off testing remains

54
00:01:39,370 --> 00:01:39,821
pending.

55
00:01:39,971 --> 00:01:41,964
This release does not settle rupiah

56
00:01:41,964 --> 00:01:43,350
or verify goods delivery.

57
00:01:44,450 --> 00:01:46,799
The next step is a small, prearranged

58
00:01:46,799 --> 00:01:48,565
merchant pilot, followed by

59
00:01:48,565 --> 00:01:49,550
security review.

60
00:01:49,700 --> 00:01:51,507
Explore the live workspace

61
00:01:51,507 --> 00:01:52,845
and public evidence.

62
00:01:52,995 --> 00:01:55,021
Liber, Ghost Protocol.

63
00:01:55,171 --> 00:01:57,057
Your battery gets a break.

64
00:01:57,207 --> 00:01:59,350
Your permission keeps its limits.
